# Copy to `worker/.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev` / `make worker-dev`.
# Only needed if you hit the /api/auth/* routes locally.
#
# Production sets this as a real secret: `wrangler secret put SESSION_SIGNING_KEY`.
# Tests use the value in vitest.workers.config.ts.
SESSION_SIGNING_KEY=dev-only-not-a-secret

# Push notifications (FEATURE_BACKLOG.md) — all optional; apnsConfigFromEnv()
# is a no-op until every one of APNS_KEY_ID/APNS_TEAM_ID/APNS_PRIVATE_KEY/
# APNS_TOPIC is set (NEXT_STEPS.md Phase 6's owner action: enable Push
# Notifications on the App ID, generate a .p8 Auth Key in the Apple Developer
# portal). Production sets these as real secrets (`wrangler secret put ...`);
# APNS_PRIVATE_KEY is the whole .p8 file's contents, literal newlines and all.
# APNS_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox for an Xcode debug build's device tokens
# (unset/anything else = production, for TestFlight/App Store builds).
# APNS_KEY_ID=
# APNS_TEAM_ID=
# APNS_PRIVATE_KEY=
# APNS_TOPIC=com.clantab.app
# APNS_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox

# GET /api/admin/reports (SHIP_PLAN.md Track 3 §7, Apple Guideline 1.2) —
# the content-report review endpoint. Unset means it 404s for everyone,
# never wide open by default. Production sets this as a real secret
# (`wrangler secret put ADMIN_TOKEN`) — pick any strong random value.
# ADMIN_TOKEN=

# Image storage (CHECKLIST.md "Image storage backend (R2)") — the R2 S3-API
# credentials POST /api/media/presign signs upload/view URLs with. All three
# unset → that endpoint returns 503, same "safe until configured" posture as
# APNS_*. Get them from the Cloudflare dashboard: R2 → Manage R2 API Tokens →
# Create API Token (Object Read & Write, scoped to the buckets); the Account ID
# is on the R2 overview page.
#
# R2_BUCKET here points local uploads at the PREVIEW bucket so `wrangler dev
# --remote` never touches prod objects (prod's value lives in wrangler.jsonc
# `vars`). Production sets the three credentials as real secrets:
#   wrangler secret put R2_ACCOUNT_ID
#   wrangler secret put R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID
#   wrangler secret put R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
# R2_BUCKET=clantab-media-preview
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
